IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-TRACE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 TURN-INDEX          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 WRITEBACK-VALS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 FAULT-OBS           PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 EVENTS-LOGGED       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-TRACE.
    MOVE TURN-INDEX TO EVENTS-LOGGED.
    ADD 1 TO EVENTS-LOGGED.

    MOVE TURN-INDEX TO WRITEBACK-VALS.
    DIVIDE 4 INTO WRITEBACK-VALS.
    ADD 1 TO WRITEBACK-VALS.

    MOVE 0 TO FAULT-OBS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 TURN-INDEX.
    WEIGHT 30 EVENTS-LOGGED.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
